{"id":703,"name":"carbink","speciesId":703,"dex":703,"form":"normal","generation":6,"types":["rock","fairy"],"stats":{"hp":50,"attack":50,"defense":150,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":150,"speed":50},"abilities":[{"name":"clear-body","hidden":false},{"name":"sturdy","hidden":true}],"height":3,"weight":57,"baseExp":100,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/703.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/703.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/703.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/703.ogg","genus":"Jewel Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon joia","flavor":[{"version":"x","text":"Born from the temperatures and pressures deep underground, it fires beams from the stone in its head."},{"version":"y","text":"It has slept underground for hundreds of millions of years since its birth. It’s occasionally found during the excavation of caves."},{"version":"sun","text":"Born from the high temperatures and pressures deep underground, it defends itself by firing beams from the jewel part of its body."},{"version":"moon","text":"Although this Pokémon is not especially rare, its glittering, jewel-draped body draws attention from people."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Some say that deep beneath the surface of the world, a pack of Carbink live with their queen in a kingdom of jewels."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"To keep the jewels on their bodies free of tarnish, packs of Carbink use their soft manes to polish one another’s jewels."},{"version":"sword","text":"When beset by attackers, Carbink wipes them all out by firing high-energy beams from the gems embedded in its body."},{"version":"shield","text":"It’s said that somewhere in the world, there’s a mineral vein housing a large pack of slumbering Carbink. It’s also said that this pack has a queen."}],"flavorPt":"Diz-se que em algum lugar do mundo existe um veio mineral que abriga um grande pacote de Carbink adormecidos. Também é dito que este bando tem uma rainha.","genderRate":-1,"captureRate":60,"eggGroups":["fairy","mineral"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"carbink","speciesId":703,"evolvesTo":[]},"varieties":[{"id":703,"name":"carbink","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/703.png"}],"games":[15,16,17,18,20,25],"moves":[{"id":33,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":38,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":88,"learn":[[15,"lv",5],[16,"lv",5],[17,"lv",5],[18,"lv",5]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":94,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":104,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":106,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":113,"learn":[[15,"lv",60],[15,"tm",0],[16,"lv",60],[16,"tm",0],[17,"lv",60],[17,"tm",0],[18,"lv",60],[18,"tm",0],[20,"lv",30],[20,"tm",0],[25,"lv",30],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":115,"learn":[[15,"lv",18],[15,"tm",0],[16,"lv",18],[16,"tm",0],[17,"lv",18],[17,"tm",0],[18,"lv",18],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":148,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":153,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":156,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":157,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"lv",35],[20,"tm",0],[25,"lv",35],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":159,"learn":[[15,"lv",8],[16,"lv",8],[17,"lv",8],[18,"lv",8]]},{"id":164,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":173,"learn"